    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just hard to see it that way when the reality is so different. they have to watch me struggle every single day. it feels like i'm stealing their peace. if i wasn't here, they wouldn't have to worry about my moods or the money or how much i'm failing. wouldn't it be more selfless to just... step aside and let them breathe?",
